<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Theneas" data-copy-zh="Theneas">Theneas</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reach the secluded Forest Hut, meet Theneas, and check access to his Soul Stone refinements." data-copy-zh="沿幽僻小径抵达森林小屋，认识 Theneas，并查清灵魂石升级服务的条件。">Reach the secluded Forest Hut, meet Theneas, and check access to his Soul Stone refinements.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Theneas at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Reach the hut</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">A useful woodland contact</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Talk and Soul Stone refinements</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If a service is missing</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Theneas</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">怎么到森林小屋</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">这位林间熟人能做什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">交谈与灵魂石强化</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">找不到服务时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Complete_Upgrade_Recipes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Soul_Stone_Upgrade_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Theneas at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Theneas — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/theneas.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Theneas — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/theneas.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Theneas — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Theneas is the fox-beastkin veteran at the Forest Hut. Visit for quiet conversation and the Soul Stone Upgrade service.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Location_and_Availability"></span><h2>Reach the hut</h2><p>From <strong>Medieval → Village Outskirts → Royal Hunting Grounds (Edge)</strong>, choose <strong>Go to Secluded Trail → Go to Forest Hut</strong>. These travel steps cost no time. The hut entrance requires the current <strong>latest supporter-code unlock</strong>.</p><p>Theneas is at the hut <strong>all day, every day</strong>, with no relationship requirement for his appearance.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>A useful woodland contact</h2><p>You can speak to him from Stranger. His current personal visits do not include a separate quest chain, date or Heart-to-Heart. A strong bond with Foxy,3000 affection, improves his relationship gains; it is not an entrance requirement.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Talk and Soul Stone refinements</h2><p><strong>Talk:</strong>15 minutes,1 base affection, up to three times daily.</p><p><strong>Soul Stone Upgrade:</strong>open from his portrait when you own an eligible Soul Stone and have the service’s supporter-code unlock. Opening the service costs no time. Refinements consume the specific Infinity Dungeon drops shown for the owned stone. Use the Soul Stones guide for the eight recipes and their effects.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Order_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>If a service is missing</h2><ul><li>A locked hut needs its supporter unlock, not a higher relationship with Theneas.</li><li>The upgrade action needs an owned eligible Soul Stone as well as the service’s supporter-code unlock.</li><li>Check the exact Infinity drop recipe in the service; generic dungeon materials do not replace the required drops.</li><li>After three ordinary talks, wait until the next game day for more normal gains.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones — refinement recipes and effects</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">Infinity Dungeons — eligible monster drops</a></li><li><a href="character-foxy.html">Foxy — relationship progression</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations — the secluded trail</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Complete_Upgrade_Recipes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Soul_Stone_Upgrade_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>先认识 Theneas</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Theneas 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/theneas.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Theneas 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/theneas.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Theneas 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Theneas 是住在森林小屋的狐族老兵，可以找他交谈，或使用灵魂石升级服务。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Location_and_Availability"></span><h2>怎么到森林小屋</h2><p>从<strong>中世纪 → 村庄郊外 → 皇家狩猎场（边缘）</strong>出发，依次选择<strong>「前往幽僻小径」→「前往森林小屋」</strong>。这两段移动不消耗时间，小屋入口需要当前的<strong>最新支持者代码解锁</strong>。</p><p>Theneas<strong>每天全天都在小屋</strong>，出现本身不要求关系阶段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>这位林间熟人能做什么</h2><p>陌生人阶段就能交谈。他当前没有另外的个人任务链、约会或谈心。与 Foxy 达到 3000 好感有助于提高他的好感收益，但不影响是否能进入小屋。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>交谈与灵魂石强化</h2><p><strong>交谈：</strong>15 分钟、1 点基础好感，每天三次。</p><p><strong>灵魂石升级：</strong>拥有相应灵魂石，并兑换解锁该服务的支持者代码后，从他的头像进入服务。打开菜单不消耗时间，强化会消耗该灵魂石要求的无限地下城掉落物。八种配方与效果请看灵魂石指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Order_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>找不到服务时</h2><ul><li>小屋上锁时，需要对应支持者解锁，提高 Theneas 好感不能代替入口条件。</li><li>升级行动需要已经拥有相应灵魂石，并兑换解锁该服务的支持者代码。</li><li>按菜单核对无限地下城掉落物；普通材料不能替代指定配方。</li><li>当天正常交谈三次后，等下一个游戏日再来。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>接下来可以查阅</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石：强化配方与效果</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">无限地下城：所需掉落物</a></li><li><a href="character-foxy.html">Foxy：关系成长</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点：僻静小径</a></li></ul></section>
